        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "9 is not the largest square factor of 72; use 36.",
          "worked": "The highest square factor of 72 is 36. Using $72=36\\times2$ removes the square factor in one step, whereas using $9\\times8$ leaves another square factor inside $\\sqrt8$.",
